      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِقْصَارٌ</span></b>  (S, M, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِقْصَارَةٌ</span> (S, K) <i>A necklace,</i> or <i>collar,</i> or <i>the like,</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِلَادَةٌ</span>, (S, M, K,)
<i>resembling a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْنَقَة</span>: (S:) so called because it
cleaves to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَرَة</span> [or base] of the neck: (M:)
or <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْنَقَة</span> <i>proportioned to the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَرَة</span> [or <i>base of
the neck</i>]: (A, TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَاصِيرُ</span>. (S, K.)

